	DS.W	1			;number of items in windowwindUsed	DS.L	1			;number of bytes used in windowwindFree	DS.L	1			;number of bytes free on diskwindFST		ds.w	1			;file system our window haswindAccess	ds.w	1			;appleshare privs for this windowwindDirty	ds.w	1			;is our window dirty?windTitle	DS.B	54			;window's titlewindMenuItem	ds.w	1			;window's menu itemwindMenuText	ds.b	52			;window's menu textpopValue	DS	PopVal			;current pop up settingspopDefault	DS	PopVal			;default pop up settingscardTable	DS.L	5			;table of card referenceswindText	DS	TextRecord		;text recordsizeOf;-----------------------------------------------		ENDR